    <string name="about_photographer_1">A dedicated wedding photography team based in %1$s, capturing every candid and posed moment in a timeless, elegant style.</string>
    <string name="about_photographer_2">An experienced photography studio in %1$s, specialising in storytelling through beautifully composed wedding imagery.</string>
    <string name="about_photographer_3">A creative photography team based in %1$s, blending documentary and fine-art styles to preserve your special day.</string>
    <string name="about_makeup_1">A professional bridal makeup studio in %1$s, specialising in flawless, long-lasting looks tailored to your wedding theme.</string>
    <string name="about_makeup_2">An experienced bridal beauty team in %1$s, offering personalised makeup and hairstyling for brides and their entourage.</string>
    <string name="about_makeup_3">A trusted makeup studio in %1$s, known for natural, radiant bridal looks that last through every celebration.</string>
    <string name="about_liveband_1">A live wedding band based in %1$s, bringing energy and elegance to your reception with a repertoire tailored to your celebration.</string>
    <string name="about_liveband_2">A versatile live music ensemble in %1$s, performing everything from romantic ballads to upbeat dance hits for your big day.</string>
    <string name="about_liveband_3">An experienced wedding band in %1$s, delivering polished live performances that keep guests on the dance floor all night.</string>
    <string name="about_emcee_1">Experienced wedding emcees based in %1$s, keeping your programme running smoothly while engaging your guests throughout the event.</string>
    <string name="about_emcee_2">A professional hosting team in %1$s, blending warmth and humour to guide your wedding programme from start to finish.</string>
    <string name="about_emcee_3">Skilled wedding emcees in %1$s, known for confident bilingual hosting and seamless event pacing.</string>
    <string name="about_attire_1">A bridal and wedding attire specialist in %1$s, offering rentals and tailoring for the perfect look on your big day.</string>
    <string name="about_attire_2">A boutique wedding attire studio in %1$s, providing custom fittings and a curated selection of bridal and groom wear.</string>
    <string name="about_attire_3">An established attire rental house in %1$s, dedicated to helping couples find their perfect wedding day look.</string>
    <string name="about_deco_1">A wedding decoration and styling team in %1$s, transforming venues into unforgettable settings tailored to your theme.</string>
    <string name="about_deco_2">A creative event styling studio in %1$s, specialising in floral design and bespoke decor for every wedding theme.</string>
    <string name="about_deco_3">An experienced wedding deco team in %1$s, known for elegant, detail-driven setups that elevate any venue.</string>
